{"detail": {"templateUuid": "ad096c23c99c41abbfea76a28931cd7e", "projectUuid": "dde504b220f4491db5de00a0c6e546d5", "name": "大笨象会跳舞-再五分钟", "description": "小时候，我们总对妈妈说\"再讲五分钟\"；长大后，是妈妈对我们说\"再坐五分钟\"。这五分钟，我们一直以为随时都能拿到，所以从来没有认真要过，也从来没有认真给过。\n这部片讲的是一个没讲完的睡前故事。1972年，年轻的阿珍每晚给女儿编一个小姑娘去月亮家的故事，每次都讲到\"黑黑的林子\"就停下，说\"明天再讲\"。后来女儿长大了，没空听了；再后来，外孙女也被匆匆带走。这个故事在\"林子\"那里停了一辈子，直到抢救室里最后的五分钟，女儿才第一次把它讲完。", "coverUrl": "/assets/84d6ee2ad34de524.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/79f617d0595e4ad7b0f9c8058fd89b2d/704da9d69597bbce01a9422fc9eb162af7593079.mp4", "snapshotId": 51102, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 11773535, "ownerUuid": "467ebbf8b17f4f9a97aaf17ef8c44ab5", "avatar": "/assets/8385143ae482ebeb.webp", "nickname": "大笨象会跳舞1", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 10, "tags": [{"id": 3062, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "LibTV·「X小时之后」AI短片黑客松", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3062/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/M9BVxdVSPRs/", "createAt": "2026年09月30日 12:51", "updateAt": "2026年09月30日 13:01", "publishAt": "2026年09月30日 12:51", "playCount": 115, "viewCreationProcessCount": 43, "copyCanvasCount": 10, "shareCount": 2, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/ad096c23c99c41abbfea76a28931cd7e.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 631, "edges": 1008}}, "recommendList": []}